[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 9068.23, "timestamp": "02:31:08", "text": "曼洛克已经把你们都带到了你们身边"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9070.46, "timestamp": "02:31:10", "text": "消亡。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9072.95, "timestamp": "02:31:12", "text": "[音乐]"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9096.309, "timestamp": "02:31:36", "text": "确实如此。我应该做什么？我能做什么？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9098.95, "timestamp": "02:31:38", "text": "做是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9102.23, "timestamp": "02:31:42", "text": "其实我感觉已经饱了。不，我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9105.83, "timestamp": "02:31:45", "text": "我吃饱了。所以，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9110.309, "timestamp": "02:31:50", "text": "某种程度上，我内心深处想要……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9112.55, "timestamp": "02:31:52", "text": "实际上，卖掉这些东西可以赚钱，但是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9114.55, "timestamp": "02:31:54", "text": "显然"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9118.15, "timestamp": "02:31:58", "text": "我不能。没关系。"}]